  "releaseNotes": "# Changes from version 9.1.2:\n\n## Fixed\n- Incorrect handling of Charts inside nested Shape groups when opening a Workbook.(DSX-14372)\n- Incorrect Sort results for in-cell Images when sorting a Range that contains Images without alternative text.(DSX-14381)\n- Failure to open valid XLSX Workbooks whose theme elements use a default namespace.(DSX-14391)\n- Incorrect black Worksheet tab color when clearing the tab color with an empty value.(DSX-14415)\n- Incorrect date formatting for non-English Workbook cultures in Cell text and PDF output.(DSX-14421)\n- Incorrect Worksheet Formula evaluation when custom names supplied by a Formula resolver return text or numeric values.(DSX-14435)\n- Unexpected sharing of Worksheet and Range metadata across Worksheets generated by template processing.(DSX-14490)",
